# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f apps/vend/Dockerfile`
# (per-Dockerfile ignore file), so the repo-root build context holds only the
# two workspaces the image compiles: vend and the mint crates it path-depends on
# (vend-mint-client -> apps/mint/crates/{mint-core,mint-protocol,...}).
*
!apps/vend/Cargo.toml
!apps/vend/Cargo.lock
!apps/vend/crates
!apps/mint/Cargo.toml
!apps/mint/crates
!apps/mint/contracts
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.env*
